==Battleground==
*4 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For this stage, there is a [[St. Pigge the 2nd]], so you'd want to bring anti-red cats like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cat]], or [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Sword Master Cat]]. Make sure to have a steady line of defense for the [[Zroco]]s that spawn, as they can do up to 5,000 damage to your base/cats in one hit. The rest of the level will be easy, as the [[Pigge]]s that spawn after the boss won't punch through your frontline as easily due to the abundance of anti-reds.

